<title>JAPAN: Japan 20-yr bond auction lowest price 99.70.</title>
<headline>Japan 20-yr bond auction lowest price 99.70.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>An auction of 400 billion yen in 20-year government bonds on Tuesday produced the following results, the Ministry of Finance said:</p>
<p> Lowest price	 99.70    Stop rate	   3.324 pct</p>
<p> Average price	99.76    Average yield     3.319 pct</p>
<p> Total bids	   1.33 trillion yen</p>
<p> Accepted Bids	398.4 billion yen</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 35.633 pct Issue date:Jan 31, 1997;Maturity:March 20, 2017</p>
</text>
